{"ref":"BDB, לוּעַ","hw":"לוּעַ","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">לוּעַ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\"></span>or <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַע</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. swallow, swallow down (</strong>Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܠܰܥ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܠܳܥ</span> <em>lap</em> or <em>lick up</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:5-7\" href=\"/Judges.7.5-7\">Ju 7:5–7</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְלָע֫וּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:16\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.16\">Ob 16</a> (Ges<sup>§ 67 R. 12</sup>);—abs., fig. of nations drinking (cup of judgment).—Hi De <em>talk wildly</em>, vid. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, לוּן²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_לוּן²\">II. לוע</a>; We Now <span dir=\"rtl\">נָעוּ</span> <em>reel, totter</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.20\">Is 24:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.9\">29:9</a>).","next":"BDB, לֹעַ","prev":"BDB, תְּלֻנָּה"}